<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7175" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caulae</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caullae</span></b> ,
			ārum, f.
		apparently contr. from cavile, <i><span class="en">Varr. L. L. 5, § 20, p. 8</span></i>
			Bip., from cavus; cf. Paul. ex <i><span class="en">Fest. p.
				46</span></i>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.,
				<i>an opening</i>, <i>hole</i>, <i>passage</i> (so most freq. in Lucr.), <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2,
			951</span></i>; <i><span class="en">3, 707</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per caulas corporis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					255</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">3, 702</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">6, 839</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per caulas palati,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 4,
					620</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">4, 660</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">per caulas aetheris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 6,
					492</span></i>
			: intra caulas (aedis Saturni), Lex Corn. XX Quaest. 2, 41;
			cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">caulae (Jani) pace clauduntur,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 1, 9</span></i>
			; v. <i><span class="en">Lucr. 2, p. 374 sq.</span></i> Lachm.
			—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> Esp.
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>A sheepfold</i> or <i>cote</i>, <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 9,
				60</span></i> Serv.—* </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>An enclosure,</i>
			<i><span class="en">Inscr. Murat. 191, 3</span></i>.</div>
